  "review_note": "Initial findings retained above. Published catalogs repair campaign placeholders, verify the changed-condition text pairing, and shorten one subtitle. Executable UI is reviewed and supplemented by wc1-re contributors. Intro captions use the existing ASCII alphabet; main-menu Start/Continue frames use sparse deltas from Greg14; other artwork is not imported. SM1/SM2 text and all 86 cinematic captions imported from the same installation; four expansion placeholder mismatches corrected and the malformed SM1 debriefing record restored. Reviewed WC1/UI catalogs and artwork are retained. Seven expansion subtitles shortened to fit the renderer with maximum-width pilot names; no cinematic caption shortening was needed.",
